<div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col gap-6">
  <%= render FlatPack::PageTitle::Component.new(
    title: "Install",
    subtitle: "How to install Recording Studio Webhooks in a host app.",
    variant: :h1
  ) %>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Install steps</h2>
    <ol class="space-y-2 text-sm leading-6 list-decimal pl-5">
      <li>Add the gem to your host app Gemfile: <code>gem "recording_studio_webhooks"</code>.</li>
      <li>Install dependencies: <code>bundle install</code>.</li>
      <li>Run installer: <code>bin/rails generate recording_studio_webhooks:install</code>.</li>
      <li>Apply database changes: <code>bin/rails db:migrate</code>.</li>
      <li>Boot the app and open <code>/admin/webhooks</code> to verify install.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</div>
